WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.212
Recovery is part of performance, not a reward after performance.

2
00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:12.559
Constant output eventually reduces quality because attention, judgment, emotional control, and creativity all need renewal.

3
00:00:12.559 --> 00:00:17.000
Recovery can be short or long, active or quiet, individual or social.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.059
The important idea is that recovery belongs inside the system.

5
00:00:21.059 --> 00:00:25.960
If it is always postponed until everything is complete, it may never happen.

6
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.483
Breaks create transitions that help attention reset.

7
00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:32.316
A useful break does not have to be elaborate.

8
00:00:32.316 --> 00:00:41.123
It may mean stepping away from the screen, moving briefly, getting water, changing posture, or closing a loop before moving to a new task.

9
00:00:41.123 --> 00:00:52.686
Sleep matters at a general level because people need adequate rest to sustain judgment and learning, but this course does not provide sleep treatment guidance or clinical advice.

10
00:00:52.686 --> 00:01:00.037
Movement, hydration, nutrition, and emotional decompression can all support capacity in broad practical ways.

11
00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:05.092
The goal is not to prescribe a diet, supplement protocol, or performance hack.

12
00:01:05.092 --> 00:01:10.529
It is to recognize that people do better when basic needs are not treated as optional.

13
00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:19.335
A demanding work system that ignores the body and emotions will eventually pay through errors, conflict, and lower-quality execution.

14
00:01:19.335 --> 00:01:22.781
Transitions between tasks are especially valuable.

15
00:01:22.781 --> 00:01:31.281
Going straight from an intense meeting into a complex decision may preserve calendar efficiency while reducing judgment quality.

16
00:01:31.281 --> 00:01:38.786
A short transition can capture action items, clear the workspace, reset attention, and make the next start cleaner.

17
00:01:38.786 --> 00:01:41.849
Energy renewal is not about avoiding hard work.

18
00:01:41.849 --> 00:01:45.602
It is about making hard work sustainable enough to repeat.
